# The CLI image's build context: the workspace (every crate the CLI depends
# on) and the skills Navigator embeds; no front ends, benchmarks or websites.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!apps/system-app/
!skills/
!e2e/tools/cli-captures.sh
crates/**/target/
apps/**/target/
apps/**/storage/
apps/**/.env
**/node_modules/
